From 1d2462654cad2c8cf2e3350224accae6250d8fe4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: baKon <mike.ski83@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 13:56:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] serve: the model entry carries the capabilities
 /server_info reports

OpenAI's model object has no field for what a model can be asked for, so a client learned it
by sending a request and reading the refusal. The entry it already fetches now carries the same
capabilities object /server_info does (tools, reasoning, grammar, media, logprobs, the reasoning
efforts the template takes), built by one Server::capabilities() so the two cannot disagree.
---
 core/server/admin.cpp  | 44 ++++++++++++++++++++++++------------------
 core/server/oai.cpp    |  4 ++++
 core/server/oai.h      |  5 +++++
 core/server/server.cpp |  1 +
 core/server/server.h   |  4 ++++
 docs/GUIDE.md          |  2 +-
 tests/server_test.cpp  | 14 ++++++++++++++
 tests/wire_test.cpp    |  9 +++++++++
 8 files changed, 63 insertions(+), 20 deletions(-)

diff --git a/core/server/admin.cpp b/core/server/admin.cpp
